OL,3,GNEWSAPurchase of site approved for
OL,4,Acommunity woodland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council intends to buy 11 acres of
OL,7,Fland with plans to create a community
OL,8,Fwoodland.
OL,10,FNorth Devon Council's strategy and
OL,11,Fresources committee approved the
OL,12,Fpurchase of the land in Ilfracombe's
OL,13,FSlade Valley after learning on Monday,
OL,14,Ffunding was available.
OL,16,FThe council's property team had secured
OL,17,Fa price of #140,000, according to the
OL,18,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service
OL,19,F(LDRS), and the Forestry Commission
OL,20,Fwould need to approve the application
OL,21,Ffor a community woodland.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
