OL,3,GNEWSAPurchase of site approved for
OL,4,Acommunity woodland
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe North Devon Coast National
OL,7,FLandscape has offered half the purchase
OL,8,Fprice up to #82,500 and the remaining
OL,9,Fmoney will come from the Rural England
OL,10,FProsperity Fund, a government grant
OL,11,Favailable until the end of this month.
